  "body": "Moved from https://github.com/vector-im/element-web/issues/10477\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nAfter joining a room with history_visibility set to join, there's 5 state events visible in the timeline\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/23422690/62292448-bb16ac80-b466-11e9-9fd1-1ec024ebe33a.png)\r\n\r\n- f0x52\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- Join room with hidden history (history_visibily = join)\r\n- Inspect sync response\r\n\r\n> surely these guy should be in the state block but not the timeline block of the /sync response\r\n\r\n- ara4n\r\n\r\nEvents are returned in `timeline` and not `state`\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2403652/165930117-bedf75f4-c515-485d-a0ee-22602d76f526.png)",
